00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:57.540
Bam!

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.980
Now, that's dope.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.480
MATT HOOKER: Great demo, Kelsey.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.760
Obviously one of the
biggest strengths of Packer

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.620
